# Terms that must not appear in public documentation (README*, ROADMAP*, docs/, every AGENTS.md,
# CONTRIBUTING/SECURITY/STRUCTURE). Shared by check.ps1 and check.sh; matched case-insensitively.
# Format: <regex><TAB><sample the regex must match>. The sample is the gate's self-test:
# an edit that blinds a pattern fails the gate instead of passing the tree silently.
# Code is not scanned: the slugs are legal there.

\bfcrdns	the FCrDNS check
\bcensus\b	the shared-address census
\bcollateral-	slug collateral-fake-ip
\bTZ_	TZ_Windows_Network_Policy_Manager
\bspecifikaciya	specifikaciya_modeli_pravil
\bPro-only\b	a Pro-only zone
\bTASKS_RU\b	see TASKS_RU.md
